  "body": "Proposal (ping @jmanico):\r\n\r\n| # | Description | L1 | L2 | L3 | CWE | [NIST &sect;](https://pages.nist.gov/800-63-3/sp800-63b.html) |\r\n| :---: | :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |\r\n| **3.2.2** | [MODIFIED, MERGED FROM 3.2.4] Verify that if random tokens are used to represent user sessions, they are unique and generated using a cryptographically secure pseudo-random number generator (CSPRNG) and possess at least 128 bits of entropy. | ✓ | ✓ | ✓ | | |\r\n\r\nI think it will also make sense to move up into V3.1.",
  "comments": [
